item.content:encoded:
Create Amazing Props in matter of minutes to showcase your work.

&nbsp;

[props width="1020" height="500" ][prop left="20" top="0" delay="500" image="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/prop3.png" effect="fade-left" ][/prop][prop left="400" top="200" delay="800" image="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/prop1.png" effect="fade-right" ][/prop][prop left="80" top="250" delay="1500" image="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/prop2.png" effect="big-fade-top" ][/prop][/props]

Content Type maker allows you to create custom post types in an extremely easy manner and you can also create related meta boxes for them.

[image_wrapper src="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/07/contenttyoes1.jpg" texture="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/webtreats_wood-pattern8-512.jpg"]

&nbsp;

[image_wrapper src="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/07/custom2.png" texture="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/webtreats_wood-pattern8-512.jpg"]

&nbsp;

[image_wrapper src="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/07/custom1.png" texture="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/webtreats_wood-pattern8-512.jpg"]

[video width="740" height="500" ]https://vimeo.com/72606821[/video]

The Most Powerful and complete Title Area Manager, you have ever come across. Jam packed with features you always wanted. Set any font you like or size you like. You can even set color and intro animation. And that'st the beginning , you can set background color , gradient and background image to title area. Not only that you can also add background motion to it.

[image_wrapper src="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/07/titlearea1.jpg" texture='http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/webtreats_wood-pattern8-512.jpg' /]

&nbsp;

[image_wrapper src="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/07/titlearea11.jpg" texture='http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/webtreats_wood-pattern8-512.jpg' /]

&nbsp;

[image_wrapper src="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/07/titlearea21.jpg" texture='http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/webtreats_wood-pattern8-512.jpg' /]

&nbsp;

[image_wrapper src="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/07/titlearea31.jpg" texture='http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/webtreats_wood-pattern8-512.jpg' /]

We have a powerful font manger that will fulfill all your needs to create an amazing experience. Select from over 500 google fonts or add your own using font face or using font deck. We have got everything covered.

[image_wrapper src="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/07/fontmanager1.jpg" texture="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/webtreats_wood-pattern8-512.jpg"]

&nbsp;

[image_wrapper src="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/07/fontmanager11.jpg" texture="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/webtreats_wood-pattern8-512.jpg"]

&nbsp;

[image_wrapper src="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/07/fontmanager2.jpg" texture="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/webtreats_wood-pattern8-512.jpg"]

Limitless is built with High SEO performance in mind.  Proper headings,  deep linkings  , compatibility with Yoast's All in One SEO plugins are some of the seo enhancements Limitless provides. On top of that Limitless hosts it's own SEO settings to give full control of page's seo output. And microformats are supported to give even higher SEO value.

&nbsp;

[image_wrapper src="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/07/seo11.jpg" texture="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/webtreats_wood-pattern8-512.jpg"]

&nbsp;

[image_wrapper src="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/07/seo1.jpg" texture="http://getioa.com/limitless/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/08/webtreats_wood-pattern8-512.jpg"]

